{
  "comment": "job_complete lines in the shape lentago/claytonia#173 settles: cost_usd null for Gemini and Codex, `tokens` totals and `tokens_by_model`, each with five disjoint fields (in, cached, cache_write, out, thinking). Prices are claude-cost-export/pricing.json's runner rows, rendered into the panels by terraform/modules/runner-cost. Every line sits inside the 1h range.",
  "cases": [
    "per MTok; cost = in*input + cached*cached_input + cache_write*cache_write + (out+thinking)*output",
    "g1 gemini-3.5-flash-lite: 100000*0.30 + 200000*0.03 + 30000*2.50 = 30000 + 6000 + 75000 = 111000 -> $0.111",
    "g2 gemini-3-flash-preview: 200000*0.50 + 400000*0.05 + 20000*3.00 = 100000 + 20000 + 60000 = 180000 -> $0.18",
    "g3 gemini-3.1-pro-preview: 50000*2.00 + 100000*0.20 + 10000*12.00 = 100000 + 20000 + 120000 = 240000 -> $0.24",
    "g4 gemini-3.8-flash, finished 2026-12-31T23:59:59Z (introductory): 100000*0.75 + 1000000*0.075 + 10000*3.75 = 75000 + 75000 + 37500 = 187500 -> $0.1875",
    "g5 gemini-3.8-flash, finished 2027-01-01T00:00:01Z (standard): 100000*1.50 + 1000000*0.15 + 10000*7.50 = 150000 + 150000 + 75000 = 375000 -> $0.375",
    "g6 gate-209b's shape (three models, model=default): flash-lite 5689*0.30 + 952*2.50 = 4086.7; 3.8-flash 125620*0.75 + 941103*0.075 + 10538*3.75 = 94215 + 70582.725 + 39517.5 = 204315.225; 3-flash-preview 4079*0.50 + 422*3.00 = 3305.5; total 211707.425 -> $0.211707",
    "g7 gate-211's shape (main model switched to pro; 3.8-flash at zero tokens): flash-lite 5690*0.30 + 625*2.50 = 3269.5; pro 43936*2.00 + 131671*0.20 + 2123*12.00 = 87872 + 26334.2 + 25476 = 139682.2; total 142951.7 -> $0.142952",
    "c1 gpt-6.1-sol, gate-216's shape with cache writes split out: 15*2.00 + 78540*0.10 + 23138*2.50 + 821*10.00 = 30 + 7854 + 57845 + 8210 = 73939 -> $0.073939",
    "g8 gemini-3.5-flash-lite with no `finished`: a single-period row needs no date, 10000*0.30 + 1000*2.50 = 3000 + 2500 = 5500 -> $0.0055",
    "g9 a model with no row (gemini-2.5-pro) called at zero tokens beside a priced router: the zero entry prices nothing either way, so the job is priced at the router's 2000*0.30 + 400*2.50 = 600 + 1000 = 1600 -> $0.0016 (lentago/claytonia#173 keeps zero-token entries)",
    "k1 claude, cost_usd 1: native cost, its tokens ignored",
    "unknown, never $0 and never priced as another model: u1 gemini-2.5-pro has no row; u2 codex model key \"unknown\"; u3 claude failure, cost null (the Claude rows never price tokens); u4 cache_write tokens on gemini-3.5-flash-lite, which has no write rate; u5 null token totals (tokens_by_model null); u6 all-zero tokens (no priced token at all); u7 gemini-3.8-flash, whose price depends on the date, with no `finished`",
    "spend: claude 1; gemini 0.111 + 0.18 + 0.24 + 0.1875 + 0.375 + 0.211707 + 0.142952 + 0.0055 + 0.0016 = 1.455259; codex 0.073939; unpriced 7; with the local session at 2: total 4.529198",
    "by submitter: s1 cost 1.455259 + 0.073939 = 1.529198, 0 unpriced; s2 cost 1, 0 unpriced; s3 no cost, 7 unpriced"
